# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-include files excluded by a global gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ~/.gitignore_global on this machine lists `README.md` and `package-lock.json`.
# A repository .gitignore takes precedence over core.excludesFile, so these
# negations bring both back for THIS project. Without them the repo ships with
# no README and no lockfile, and neither absence is visible in `git status`.
#
# The lockfile is kept deliberately: this project pins Nuxt to 4.3.1 because
# 4.4+ requires Node >=22.19 (see CLAUDE.md §2), and the lockfile is what makes
# the rest of the dependency tree reproducible on a fresh install.
!README.md
!package-lock.json
